==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[blood-thirsty]] {{qualifier|obsolete}}
* [[bloud-thirsty]] {{qualifier|obsolete}}
* [[bloudthirsty]] {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|blood|thirsty}}. Compare {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|bloeddorstig||bloodthirsty|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|blutdürstig||bloodthirsty|lang=de}}, {{etyl|da|-}} {{term|blodtørstig||bloodthirsty|lang=da}}, {{etyl|sv|-}} {{term|blodtörstig||bloodthristy|lang=sv}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|bloodthirsti|er|more}}

# Eager to resort to [[violence]].
# Characterized by [[massive]] [[bloodshed]].

